ui.dorios:scroll_guide.health=§f §8Max health in hearts.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.attack=§f §8Trinket damage + 1 base. Excludes weapons and critical hits.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.speed=§f §8Land speed. 100% = normal.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.water=§f §8Water speed. 100% = normal.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.steal=§f §8Hit damage restored as health (%).
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.thorns=§f §8Incoming hit damage reflected (%).
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.fire=§f §8Seconds enemies burn after your hit.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.jumps=§f §8Extra jumps before landing.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.effects=§8§lEffects
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.effect_use=§8Passive: on you. Active: on enemies you hit.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.levels=§8I, II, III, IV, V = levels 1-5. None = no effects from trinkets.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.conduit=§f §8Conduit Power: breathe, see and mine underwater.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.fire_res=§f §8Fire Resistance: protection from fire and lava.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.haste=§f §8Haste: faster mining.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.night=§f §8Night Vision: see in the dark.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.regen=§f §8Regeneration: restores health.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.resistance=§f §8Resistance: take less damage.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.falling=§f §8Slow Falling: descend slowly.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.effect_speed=§f §8Speed: move faster.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.strength=§f §8Strength: more melee damage.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.hero=§f §8Hero of the Village: better trade prices.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.breathing=§f §8Water Breathing: breathe underwater.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.levitation=§f §8Levitation: float upward.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.poison=§f §8Poison: damage over time.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.slowness=§f §8Slowness: move slower.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.immunities=§8§lImmunities
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.immune_use=§8An icon here means that effect is blocked. No level needed.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.blindness=§f §8Blindness: reduced sight.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.darkness=§f §8Darkness: darkened vision.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.hunger=§f §8Hunger: faster hunger loss.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.immune_poison=§f §8Blocks poison damage.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.immune_regen=§f §8Blocks Regeneration, including its healing.
ui.dorios:scroll_guide.wither=§f §8Wither: damage over time.
